#: ../../tools/gbif_ext_tools.rst:32 03c6044a5b97449db60ebaef0bbc625d
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed species information from the Global "
"Biodiversity Information Facility (GBIF) by its taxon key. Returns the "
"full taxonomic record including scientific name, authorship, rank, full "
"classification (kingdom through species), taxonomic status, basionym, "
"vernacular name, and number of descendant taxa. Use "
"GBIF\\_search\\_species first to find taxon keys. Example: key 2435099 "
"returns Puma concolor (puma) with full classification from Animalia to "
"Puma concolor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/gbif_ext_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/gbif_ext_tools.rst:65
#: 687c570fa0af438489027413e67123d5 b26d334cfc944cbe81e731a334fc1daa
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/gbif_ext_tools.rst:36 68ac567d902d4429956e26cc9938d3cc
msgid ""
"``speciesKey`` (integer) (required) GBIF species/taxon key. Examples: "
"2435099 (Puma concolor / puma), 2878688 (Quercus robur / English oak), "
"5219404 (Canis lupus / wolf), 2480528 (Homo sapiens), 2495662 (Aquila "
"chrysaetos / golden eagle). Use GBIF\\_search\\_species to find keys."
msgstr ""

